=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=123a71473816663d44f7b79f26693aea 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ce976853/uploads/origins/812ad88e-f8ca-4c37-9d8f-cbec63ca0ba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59cfc634113b5028a66e55b2ee546e2c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは、私はあなたの作品の大ファンで、私の巨乳の猫娘OC Xibiのピンナップスタイルの作品がとても欲しいです。パーカーのファスナーを開けて、乳首以外の胸がほとんど露出していて、ゲームのコントローラーを掲げているような作品や、あなたが描きたいと思うような作品をお願いします。\nXibiの参考文献：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gxFJNUJL1sceU7wNV3NiHTUVWSu751M4\n\n彼女は少しぽっちゃりしていて、やわらかいということを覚えておいてください。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bb_m0024/works/182", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7cc9cdf/uploads/origins/b27b859b-bb4e-45d0-a838-686e54c7c195?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b912066e6abef9aa16f16dd9f12bb73a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7cc9cdf/uploads/origins/b27b859b-bb4e-45d0-a838-686e54c7c195?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b912066e6abef9aa16f16dd9f12bb73a, https://si.imgix.net/a7cc9cdf/uploads/origins/b27b859b-bb4e-45d0-a838-686e54c7c195?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c25ae4e66bb2cac0b937e2ae279a95e5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7cc9cdf/uploads/origins/b27b859b-bb4e-45d0-a838-686e54c7c195?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=931a635d01dc55eddc66c904584f4b1d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello I really loved the last piece you did for me and was hoping to get another. It would be of the same OC Nakata.\n\nNakata: https://photos.app.goo.gl/AGn9zvKEGwapE4qy5\n\nPlease draw her in her jacket from the reference below.\nOutfit: https://imgur.com/a/GGzQN5W\n\nI leave the pose and expression up to you, but I would like it if it was playful or cute. Thank you for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bb_m0024/works/181", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.